      "side": 1,
      "message": "That makes the test less realistic, and we wouldn\u0027t be able to check the expected behavior when location is off; would it be possible to just make sure the test enables location ?",
      "revId": "a58914b5485d2c55cb8e4ec48b08a6f61d263e8e",
